[[Trading]]|theme=godly}}'''Flowerwood''' is an [[Effects|effect]] that was obtainable by purchasing the [[Flowerwood Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux in the [[Easter Event 2024]]. is now no longer obtainable as the gamepass has gone offsale

== Appearance ==
Blue smoke resembling the color of the [[Flowerwood Bundle]] surrounds the knife. Similar to [[Flow]], a blue aura appears around the around knife which emits a blue aura around the knife along with cyan particles.

== Trivia ==

* This is the only item within the [[Flowerwood Bundle]] that can not be purchased from a separate gamepass.
* This is the third godly effect to be introduced into the game, the first being [[Flow]], and second being [[Darkswirl]].
* This is the only godly effect without a kill effect. 
